            <ArticleTitle>Acute abdominal pain: a diagnostic approach.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>358-61, 364-74</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author presents a diagnostic approach to the problem of acute abdominal pain in adults. The typical pain patterns for the various causes are outlined with the aid of illustrations. A systematic method is necessary to make reasonably accurate provisional diagnoses. A summary of possible investigations is included for each condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
